<!--
  ValidateSidecar. Internal tool - validates a bulk-provision sidecar
  (YAML or JSON) against tools/bulk-provision/sidecar-schema.json.

  Mirrors the single-purpose tools/ pattern (SchemaGen, LicenseGen,
  ModbusCsvImport, ValidateConfig). Unlike ValidateConfig:
    * NO ProjectReference to ElpisEdgeConnect.Core
    * NO use of GatewayConfiguration
    * NO ADR-0030 suspect-roots logic
    * Generic on the schema path (passed at the command line)

  Consumed by:
    * tools/bulk-provision/generate.ps1 (Chip 3 generator). Invokes
      this CLI inline via `dotnet run` before substitution; failure
      aborts with BulkProvision.SidecarSchemaViolation.
    * Operators invoking it directly during commissioning.

  Reference:
    docs/sessions/2026-06-14-chip3-impl-session2.5-plan-v3-lock-final.md

  Usage:
    See Program.cs for the locked CLI surface and exit codes.

  YamlDotNet version: 17.1.0 (locked).
    Pin rationale: 17.1.0 carries the latest YamlDotNet security
    improvements; 18.0.0 introduced a breaking ITypeInspector change
    on 2026-05-21 that would require additional shim work for no
    immediate gain in a small validation CLI. NuGet confirms 17.1.0
    has zero dependencies for net8.0.

    A hand-rolled flat YAML parser (mirroring generate.ps1's
    ConvertFrom-Yaml-Minimal) would commit sidecars to "one-level deep
    forever," and the cost of YamlDotNet is the smaller of those two
    tradeoffs. Per chip 3 v3 §6, the YAML normalization helper is
    explicitly recursive so future nested fields work without rework.

  NJsonSchema version: 11.1.0 (matches ElpisEdgeConnect.SchemaValidation).
    Pin rationale: avoid version drift between the two repo projects
    that depend on NJsonSchema. Upgrade is a separate workstream.

  Dependency-audit gate: run `dotnet restore` then
  `dotnet list package` with the `vulnerable` and `include-transitive`
  flags. See v3 plan §7.H for the exact command line.
-->
<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <TargetFramework>net8.0</TargetFramework>
    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>
    <ImplicitUsings>enable</ImplicitUsings>
    <RootNamespace>ElpisEdgeConnect.Tools.ValidateSidecar</RootNamespace>
    <AssemblyName>ValidateSidecar</AssemblyName>
    <OutputType>Exe</OutputType>
    <IsPackable>false</IsPackable>
    <TreatWarningsAsErrors>true</TreatWarningsAsErrors>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Include="NJsonSchema" Version="11.1.0" />
    <PackageReference Include="YamlDotNet" Version="17.1.0" />
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
